  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance support to the Technical Advisory Facility (TAF) for project preparation to help Private Infrastructure Development Group (PIDG) facilities to develop infrastructure projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Technical assistance support to the Technical Advisory Facility (TAF) for project preparation to help Private Infrastructure Development Group (PIDG) facilities to develop infrastructure projects  is a component of PIDG2 - Second phase of FCDO&apos;s Support to the Private Infrastructure Development Group .  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;13,116,301. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Energy generation, non-renewable sources, unspecified, Information and communication technology (ICT), Transport policy and administrative management, Low-cost housing, Sanitation - large systems, Agricultural services.</narrative>
  </description>
